    "title": "Bagel Breakthrough, Einstein Bros. Crashes Cypress Breakfast Scene on Tuckerton - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By John Becker ,\n1 days ago Without much fanfare, Einstein Bros. Bagels has slipped into Cypress, opening its first neighborhood bakery this week at 20725 Tuckerton Road, Suite 400, and bringing fresh baked bagels, egg sandwiches, and coffee to the Fry Road corridor. The shop is running seven days a week from 6 a.m. to 2 p.m., and management says the location created roughly 15 local jobs and offers full catering for meetings and events. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
